We already build websites for Caerphilly businesses, including [Davies Property Development](/portfolio/davies-property-development/), [Pro-Tech Plumbing](/portfolio/pro-tech-plumbing/) and [RAP Roofing](/portfolio/rap-roofing/). Need a new site to support your SEO? See our [Caerphilly web design service](/web-design-caerphilly/).

## Why local SEO matters in Caerphilly

Caerphilly customers can just as easily pick a business from Cardiff, Newport or the valleys, and Google decides who they see first. For searches like "roofer Caerphilly" or "electrician near me", the three map results and the top few websites take most of the calls.

Local SEO puts your business in those spots: a strong Google Business Profile, a page for each service, and consistent signals that you are a trusted local business.

## What our Caerphilly SEO service includes

- **Local keyword research:** what people really search for in Caerphilly, Bedwas, Ystrad Mynach, Blackwood and Risca
- **Google Business Profile optimisation:** services, categories, photos, posts and a simple review routine
- **Service and area pages:** clear pages that match each service and the towns you cover
- **On-page and technical fixes:** titles, speed, mobile layout and indexing
- **Local citations and links:** consistent listings and relevant local links
- **Monthly reporting:** calls, enquiries, clicks and rankings, in plain English

