## Frequently asked questions

**How long does SEO take?** Usually three to six months for meaningful results.

**Can you guarantee rankings?** No. No honest SEO company can guarantee specific rankings, but you will see exactly what we do and how your visibility changes every month.

**Do I need a new website first?** Not always. We start with a free review of your current site and tell you honestly whether it can rank as it is.

**Do you work outside Caerphilly?** Yes. We cover all of South Wales and the UK.

